= Artificial intelligence =

This category groups knowledge on the scientific and engineering study of artificial intelligence, including machine learning, intelligent agents, representation, inference, planning and evaluation. It is a '''browse category''', not a second semantic authority or a newly invented [[Property:Domain|Domain]].

== Scope ==
Includes [[Artificial intelligence]], [[Machine learning]], [[AI agent]], [[Multi-agent system]], [[Large language model]], [[Common-token bias]], [[Positional bias (language model)]], [[Sycophancy (artificial intelligence)]], and related research. Distinguish empirical algorithmic performance, reported behavior, operational agent identity and claims about subjective experience.

